      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Contemptor-Osiron | 5 | 5 | 6 | 13 | 12 | 10 | 4 | 3
Force Organisation:
• Elites
• 0–1
Unit Composition:
• 1 Contemptor-Osiron
Unit Type:
• Vehicle (Walker)
Wargear:
• Osiron Force Blade with built-in Twin-linked Bolter
• Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon
• Smoke Launchers
• Searchlight
Special Rules:
• Atomantic Shielding
• Fleet
• Psyker (Mastery Level 1\)
• Psychic Dreadnought
• Aetheric Battle-Engine
OPTIONS
• The Osiron may be upgraded to:
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\) ..................... +25 points
If upgraded to Mastery Level 2, it selects one additional psychic power.
• The Twin-linked Bolter built into the Osiron Force Blade
may be replaced with:
• Heavy Flamer ................................. +10 points
• Graviton Gun ................................. +15 points
• Meltagun ..................................... +15 points
• The Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon may be replaced with:
• Twin-linked Heavy Bolter ........................ Free
• Multi-Melta ..................................... Free
• Twin-linked Autocannon ....................... +10 points
• Plasma Cannon ................................ +10 points
• Twin-linked Volkite Culverin ................. +15 points
• Kheres Assault Cannon ........................ +15 points
• Twin-linked Lascannon ........................ +25 points
• The Osiron may take:
• Extra Armour ................................... +5 points
PSYCHIC DREADNOUGHT The Osiron selects one psychic power from: • Biomancy • Divination • Pyromancy • Telekinesis • Telepathy It takes Psychic Tests using Leadership 9. If upgraded to Mastery Level 2, it selects a second power from the same list. If the Osiron suffers Perils of the Warp, it suffers one automatic Glancing Hit. Automatic Shielding may not prevent this hit. The Osiron is not assigned to a Prosperine Cult. AETHERIC BATTLE-ENGINE The Osiron may invoke psychic powers during a player turn in which it also fires its weapons. A psychic shooting power may be resolved in addition to the Osiron's normal shooting attacks. No more than one psychic shooting power may be used in addition to its normal weapons during the same Shooting phase. Unless another rule permits otherwise, all shooting attacks made by the Osiron during that Shooting phase must target the same enemy unit. OSIRON FORCE BLADE The Osiron Force Blade counts as both a Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon and a Force Weapon. Force Weapon activation does not count as invoking a psychic power.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r19-r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-psy" name="Psychic Dreadnought" hidden="false"><description>The Osiron is a Psyker (Mastery Level 1), tests on Leadership 9 and selects one power from Biomancy, Divination, Pyromancy, Telekinesis or Telepathy. If upgraded to Mastery Level 2 it selects a second power from the same list. Perils of the Warp causes one automatic Glancing Hit which Automatic Shielding may not prevent. The Osiron is not assigned to a Prosperine Cult.</description></rule><rule id="r19-r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-battle" name="Aetheric Battle-Engine" hidden="false"><description>The Osiron may invoke psychic powers in a turn in which it fires weapons. One psychic shooting power may be resolved in addition to its normal shooting attacks; unless another rule permits otherwise, all its shooting that phase must target the same enemy unit.</description></rule><rule id="r19-r41-unit-xv-4-contemptor-osiron-dreadnought-blade" name="Osiron Force Blade" hidden="false"><description>Counts as both a Dreadnought Close Combat Weapon and a Force Weapon. Force Weapon activation does not count as invoking a psychic power.</description></rule></rules>
