      <rules>
        <rule name="Source Entry" id="r41-unit-xv-8-magistus-amon-the-hidden-source" hidden="true">
          <description>Magistus Amon | 5 | 5 | 4 | 4 | 2 | 5 | 3 | 10 | 2+
Force Organisation:
• HQUnit Type:
• Infantry (Character)
Wargear:
• Armour of Shades
• Prosperine Force Weapon
• Bolt pistol
• Frag grenades
Special Rules:
• Legiones Astartes (Thousand Sons)
• Independent Character
• Master of the Legion
• Psyker (Mastery Level 2\)
• Athanaeans
• The Hidden One
RESTRICTION
Amon may only be included in a Thousand Sons army of 1,500 points or more.
OPTIONS
• Amon may take:
• Krak grenades .................................. +2 points
ATHANAEANS Amon always belongs to the Athanaeans and may not select another Prosperine Cult. He receives both the Athanaean Cult Arcana and Cult Mastery benefits. PSYCHIC POWERS Amon selects both of his psychic powers from the ProHammer Telepathy discipline. ARMOUR OF SHADES The Armour of Shades grants Amon a 2+ Armour Save. Amon receives a 5+ Cover Save even while in open ground. If Amon would normally receive a Cover Save from terrain or another rule, improve that Cover Save by two steps, to a maximum of 3+. THE HIDDEN ONE While Amon is joined to a friendly Thousand Sons Infantry unit, that unit receives the same protection as his Armour of Shades: • it receives a 5+ Cover Save while in open ground; • any existing Cover Save is improved by two steps, to a maximum of 3+. Amon and any Infantry unit he has joined also gain Infiltrate. This rule may not be conferred to: • models wearing any form of Terminator Armour; • Bikes; • Jetbikes; • Jump Infantry. MASTER OF THE HIDDEN ORDERS Instead of selecting a normal Legion Command Squad, Amon may select one of the following as his personal retinue: • Ammitara Occult Intercession Cabal • Legion Seeker Squad The selected unit does not occupy a separate Force Organisation slot. Amon and the selected unit count as a single HQ selection.</description>
        </rule>
      <rule id="r19-amon-cult" name="Athanaeans" hidden="false"><description>Amon always belongs to the Athanaeans and receives both the Athanaean Cult Arcana and Cult Mastery.</description></rule><rule id="r19-amon-powers" name="Psychic Powers" hidden="false"><description>Amon selects both of his psychic powers from Telepathy.</description></rule><rule id="r19-amon-armour" name="Armour of Shades" hidden="false"><description>Grants a 2+ Armour Save. Amon receives a 5+ Cover Save in open ground; an existing Cover Save improves by two steps, to a maximum of 3+.</description></rule><rule id="r19-amon-hidden" name="The Hidden One" hidden="false"><description>While Amon is joined to a friendly Thousand Sons Infantry unit, that unit receives the same Cover Save protection as the Armour of Shades and gains Infiltrate. This may not be conferred to Terminator Armour models, Bikes, Jetbikes or Jump Infantry.

Infiltrate: During deployment, may be set up after normal deployment. The unit must be set up 12" or more away from enemy units that do not have line of sight and 18" or more away from enemy units with line of sight. The unit also gains Outflank.</description></rule><rule id="r19-amon-retinue" name="Master of the Hidden Orders" hidden="false"><description>Instead of a normal Legion Command Squad, Amon may select one Ammitara Occult Intercession Cabal or Legion Seeker Squad as his personal retinue. It occupies no separate Force Organisation slot.</description></rule></rules>
